# run3-r4-cards-v2-slim-tracks: Bounded existing pair derivation card; use prepare_inputs.py plan/export/batch, not EEC division.
# Preparation, not a production submission or a physics validation.
# Run from repository root; all payload paths are repository-relative.
# Report 40-80,80-120,120-160 GeV; both n=1,2; strict pair pT>2.
# Stored activity is not an event cut or percentile certification.
# 10000 entries per file here is a pilot cap. Derive unweighted momentum pair counts;
# merge training counts before large-angle normalization and retain independent validation.
# This 40-160 map domain is NOT automatically sufficient for the full unfolding-support spectrum.
DataType 12
McCorrelationType 0
MatchJets 0
TriggerSelection 0
FilledHistograms 23
JetType 1
JetAxis 1
JetEtaCut 1.6
MinJetPtCut 40
MaxJetPtCut 160
CutBadPhi 0
CutWithEtaCM 0
MinMaxTrackPtFraction 0.01
MaxMaxTrackPtFraction 0.98
JetUncertainty 0
Run3JetID 1
Run3JetIDTable MiniPOG20261108
Run3JetQA 1
Run3JEC 1
Run3UsePpL1FastJet 0
ApplyJetVeto 1
JetVetoMapFile jetVetoMaps/pp2024/Summer24Prompt24_RunBCDEFGHI.root
JetVetoMapHistogram jetvetomap_all
JetVetoPtConvention stored
JetVetoInputMinPt 15
Run3TrackSelection Nominal
TrackEtaCut 2.4
MinTrackPtCut 0.5
MaxTrackPtCut 500
MaxTrackPtRelativeError 0.1
VertexMaxDistance 3.0
SubeventCut 2
TrackEfficiencyVariation 0
JetPtWeight 0
DisableTrackPairEfficiencyCorrection 1
ZVertexCut 15
LowPtHatCut -15
HighPtHatCut 5020
MultiplicityMode 0
JetRadius 0.4
WeightExponent 1 2
SmearDeltaR 0
SmearEnergyWeight 0
JetPtBinEdgesEEC 40 80 120 160
TrackPtBinEdgesEEC 0.5 1 1.5 2 2.5 3 3.5 4 300
SkipCovarianceMatrix 1
MinJetPtUnfoldingReco 20
MinJetPtUnfoldingTruth 10
CentralityBinEdges -1 100
TrackPtBinEdges 0.7 1 2 3 4 8 12 300
PtHatBinEdges 0 30 50 80 120 170 220 280 370 460
BackgroundMethods 0
MegaSkimMixing 0
EventMatchForMixing 1
BinnedMixing 0
VzMixingBins -0.5 1
HiBinMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyMixingBins 0 1
MultiplicityMixingBins -0.5 1
HFEnergyShift 0
DebugLevel 2
MaxEventsPerFile 10000
ChannelRadiusCode 4
MinPairTrackPt 2
FirstUnfoldedJetPtBin 0
LastUnfoldedJetPtBin 2
